  "headline": "PF Investigation Into Master Bank And Ministers Faces Deadlines",
  "seoTitle": "PF Investigation Into Master Bank And Ministers",
  "metaDescription": "Supreme Court Justice Edson Fachin extended a federal probe deadline as debates persist regarding reports linking government ministers to Master Bank.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
